WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.920
Another tab?

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:02.850
Hang on.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:07.460
Before you open it, Attention gives you
a first signal, right in your feed.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.580
A quick pause. Then you decide.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.950
Open the one you choose.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.600
Your goal. The time you have.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.840
A recommendation —
and the reason behind it.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.040
Read just the highlighted passages.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.400
The parts that might be new to you.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.480
Read or skim. Or save it for later.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.080
Find it again when you’re ready.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.960
Attention. Choose what deserves your time.
